Z||000001||terryk||10-12-2001||04:54 PM||||The oil pressure switch in the sender is stuck closed. Disconnect it at the sender and the pump should stop running.<P>If so, replace the sender.<P>The sender contains the sender for the gauge and the FP backup switch. If the FP relay fails, oil pressure will keep the switch closed and the engine running. They fail closed.<p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 10-12-2001).]||||reg||1
